    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543350/extras/25d340a325045c6d5663e5c22f19b578.avif?t=1749178594\" data-has-big width=800 height=241 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a fantastic world of streaming! Holoidle is a relaxing idle game where you click and strategize to gain <strong>Influence</strong> and grow your audience. Purchase assets, collect <strong>Collab Cards</strong>, and keep your chat engaged for perfect efficiency!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543350/extras/d98137251e4440bd5000f56a5a69d369.poster.avif?t=1749178594\" width=800 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543350/extras/d98137251e4440bd5000f56a5a69d369.webm?t=1749178594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543350/extras/d98137251e4440bd5000f56a5a69d369.mp4?t=1749178594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Three playable talents for you to choose</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd88\u00a0<strong>Gawr Gura</strong> -\u00a0The legendary shark idol from Atlantis!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2693\u00a0<strong>Houshou Marine</strong> -\u00a0The pirate captain arrives!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80\u00a0<strong>Calliope Mori -\u00a0</strong>The reaper is here to collect souls!<strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543350/extras/ceddff33b7fda7f50b5146b9d06a35bc.poster.avif?t=1749178594\" width=800 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543350/extras/ceddff33b7fda7f50b5146b9d06a35bc.webm?t=1749178594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543350/extras/ceddff33b7fda7f50b5146b9d06a35bc.mp4?t=1749178594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect cards from a collection of 100 unique Hololive-themed cards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn <strong>Holocoins</strong> by playing and use them to obtain\u00a0<strong>Collab Cards</strong>\u2014each one featuring iconic references and talents from Hololive history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 Rarity System \u2013 Cards range from <strong>One-Star</strong> to <strong>Four-Star</strong> <strong>Legendary</strong>, with increasing power and synergy effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 Foil Cards \u2013 Collect <strong>10 copies</strong> of a card to unlock a special <strong>Foil Version</strong> with boosted stats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd27 Strategize! \u2013 Some cards enhance assets, while others improve the strength of your overall deck. Combine them to create your own unique strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543350/extras/be3b2e79f2882f1f984ab8ac2f00460a.poster.avif?t=1749178594\" width=800 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543350/extras/be3b2e79f2882f1f984ab8ac2f00460a.webm?t=1749178594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543350/extras/be3b2e79f2882f1f984ab8ac2f00460a.mp4?t=1749178594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Maximize Your Influence Gains!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip up to <strong>six Collab Cards</strong> at a time to supercharge your influence generation. Placement matters\u2014combine synergies and position cards strategically to turn a modest 10% bonus into game-changing multipliers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 Foil Cards = <strong>Double the Power!</strong> Collect <strong>10 copies</strong> of a card to unlock its Foil Version, doubling its effectiveness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 Optimize!\u00a0\u2013 Experiment with different builds to find the most powerful combinations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543350/extras/407f46f8709343393c97d4578a27a38e.poster.avif?t=1749178594\" width=800 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543350/extras/407f46f8709343393c97d4578a27a38e.webm?t=1749178594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543350/extras/407f46f8709343393c97d4578a27a38e.mp4?t=1749178594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keep Your Idol Happy!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your idol needs love and care! Cook meals, clean up, and <strong>decorate their home</strong> with unlockable furniture to keep them happy and productive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e <strong>Holocoins\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Your idol generates <strong>1 Holocoin every 40 minutes</strong>, but keep them happy and they\u2019ll <strong>double their earnings</strong> to 1 every 20 minutes!<br>\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Customize Their Space</strong> \u2013 Unlock and arrange furniture to create the perfect idol retreat.<br>\ud83c\udf73 <strong>Tend To Their Needs\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Feed, clean, and interact with your idol to strengthen your bond and boost your progress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543350/extras/9ff0810d06f1e1d125081c41cd1d8b65.poster.avif?t=1749178594\" width=800 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543350/extras/9ff0810d06f1e1d125081c41cd1d8b65.webm?t=1749178594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543350/extras/9ff0810d06f1e1d125081c41cd1d8b65.mp4?t=1749178594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Restart, Reinvent, Rise!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Encore\u00a0</strong>lets you reset your progress while making your next run even stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Endless Progression</strong> \u2013 Each encore\u00a0<strong>doubles your base Influence per Second</strong> and stacks infinitely.<br>\u2728 <strong>Foil Power-Up</strong> \u2013 A random card in your collection upgrades to a <strong>Foil Version</strong>, boosting its stats.<br>\ud83c\udccf <strong>Keep Your Collection</strong> \u2013 All previously earned <strong>Collab Cards</strong> remain, letting you optimize your strategy with every cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is published under CCMC Corp(\u203b1)'s Indie game brand &quot;holo Indie&quot;.(\u203b2)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is allowed to be monetized under the examination and terms of &quot;holo Indie&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note that any monetized derivative work games that include Cover Corp.'s content outside of holo Indie is not covered by these terms and is not allowed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b1. About CCMC Corp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CCMC Corp. is entrusted with website management (ex: steam) including, examination, publishing and other necessary tasks by Cover Corp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b2. About &quot;holo Indie&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >holo Indie's objective is to cooperate with hololive production fans and creators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a game brand that offers &quot;Game Creator Support Program&quot; for the derivative work games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For more details about &quot;holo Indie&quot;, Please refer to the Cover Corp.'s &quot;Derivative work guidelines&quot;.</p>",
